10. Conformance

An implementation conforms to AWS if it:

Implements canonical workflow concepts.
Supports workflow governance.
Supports deterministic execution.
Preserves workflow traceability.
Supports explainability.
Maintains workflow interoperability.
11. Future Evolution

Future revisions MAY introduce:

Autonomous workflow orchestration.
AI-native engineering workflows.
Predictive workflow optimization.
Cross-enterprise workflow federation.
Self-healing workflows.
Industry-specific workflow libraries.

Extensions SHALL preserve canonical workflow semantics.

